        "en": "Na śniadanie"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "A Polish *śniadanie* is often *chleb* or a *bułka* with *masło*, *ser* and *szynka*. *Jasny chleb* is white bread and *ciemny chleb* brown or rye bread. *Biały ser* is a soft white cheese, like quark, and *żółty ser* a hard yellow one."
      }
    }
